rollment/est-client.mdx","Integra el cliente EST","Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_53":253},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_28":255,"_35":46,"_30":256,"_40":257,"_49":-7,"_13":258,"_51":259},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_53":260},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_28":262,"_35":46,"_30":263,"_40":264,"_49":-7,"_13":265,"_51":266},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_53":267},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_28":269,"_35":46,"_30":270,"_40":271,"_49":-7,"_13":272,"_51":273},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","Referencia EST","Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference",{"_53":274},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx",{"_28":276,"_35":46,"_30":277,"_40":278,"_49":-7,"_13":279,"_51":280},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","Diagnóstico de enrolamiento","Localiza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emisión e instalación.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting",{"_53":281},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment",{"_185":284},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"